3Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4769280-1846651706677454","game_id":"steam-4769280","kind":"update","title":"PATCH NOTES - Update 0.005","summary":"The following fixes/updates were added:Significant NPC management and event chains.Character relationship enhancements.Creating a custom magus in RAW mode.Add your own portraits for magi, companions and grogs.Many more events and adventures.Various fixes and smaller enhancements.Known issues:Supplementary systems like enchanting items, talismans, familiars, apprentices, not feature complete.Lengthy backlog of improvements and QoL tweaks","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-15T12:18:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706677454","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:03:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4769280-1842212951314353","game_id":"steam-4769280","kind":"update","title":"PATCH NOTES - Update 0.004","summary":"The following fixes/updates were added:Relationship links between covenant characters.Relationship links between master and apprentice.Ability to recruit a gauntleted apprentice to the covenant.Added tribunal-themed events.Description improvements in the planning screen.Enhanced trading offers from other covenants.Improved descriptions on some events.Companion missing annual covenant service should now only deduct once during Winter.Issue with event staging sequence causing race conditions.Certa","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-01T18:00:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951314353","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:03:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4769280-1840310314350401","game_id":"steam-4769280","kind":"update","title":